# Cloudflare Web Analytics
# Cookieless, privacy-preserving web analytics with zero personal data collection.
# For multi-domain Cloudflare Pages deployments (e.g. arcgym.23p.tech and arcgym.23p.dev),
# enable native Web Analytics in Cloudflare Pages dashboard (Workers & Pages > arcgym > Metrics).
# Leave VITE_CF_BEACON_TOKEN unset/empty so Cloudflare Pages edge auto-injects for all domains.
# Only specify a token if running standalone outside of Cloudflare Pages.
VITE_CF_BEACON_TOKEN=
